@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@adminToken = change-me

### Create Metric Type - VM CPU Usage
# @name createCPUMetric
POST {{baseUrl}}/metric-types
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "vm.cpu.usage",
    "entityType": "Service"
}

